    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that's a relief to hear. i was really worried it was something scary like a stroke or something. do u think i should see a doctor just to be safe or is it really just the stress? i've also been taking some melatonin at night to help me sleep, is that okay to take with the magnesium?",
