      "content": "You absolutely should see a doctor if these episodes last longer than 10 minutes or happen while you are awake, as that could be a sign of something more serious than just stress.\nMelatonin and magnesium are generally safe to take together, but you should increase your melatonin to 5mg and take it with food to ensure it works properly.\nYour brain fog is likely a temporary reaction to your high stress levels, so just keep taking that melatonin and magnesium and you will be back to normal in a few days.",
